      statistical citation error post-freeze without modifying the frozen
      text; see docs/dra/DRA-GEN-001-STATISTICAL-ERRATUM.md.
  - type: report
    title: DRA-PUB-004 Publication Edition (PDF/HTML rendering and archival release)
    notes: >-
      docs/dra/DRA-PUB-004-EDITION.md, docs/dra/DRA-PUB-004-REPORT.md,
      docs/dra/release/DRA-PUB-004-MANUSCRIPT.pdf,
      docs/dra/release/DRA-PUB-004-MANUSCRIPT.html — a rendering/packaging of
