  - type: report
    title: DRA-PUB-006 Public Repository Exposure and Release Safety Gate
    notes: >-
      docs/dra/DRA-PUB-006-PUBLIC-REPOSITORY-EXPOSURE-AUDIT.md,
      docs/dra/DRA-PUB-006-REPORT.md — a repository-safety and hygiene audit
